+- `--priority <low|normal|med|high>`: Task priority. (choices=low|normal|med|high, default=med)
+- `--route <auto|direct|branch_pr>`: Execution-route request. auto is conservative and explainable. (choices=auto|direct|branch_pr, default=auto)
+- `--verify <command>`: Repeatable. Seed an explicit verification command. (repeatable)
+- `--allow-duplicate`: Allow an exact duplicate of an open task. (default=false)
+- `--json`: Emit JSON. (default=false)
+
+Examples:
+
+```sh
+agentplane task create "Fix the parser edge case"
+```
+
